 Ticker req;data
⍝ Jarvis calls this once, when a client (such as the web page) connects to the /Ticker event stream
⍝ req - the request; req.Server is the Jarvis server, and req identifies this client's connection
⍝ Sends just this client a "welcome" event. Broadcast sends the price and news events to everyone.
⍝ Return no result (or 0) to keep the connection open
 data←⎕NS''
 data.text←'Welcome to the APL ticker: prices update every second'
⍝ v20: data←(text: 'Welcome to the APL ticker: prices update every second')
 req req.Server.SendSSE'welcome'req.Server.FormatSSE data
